  "entry": "code/manage.py",
  "notes": "Found in a public repository and run by a computer-use agent (batch public-1). A web editor where a linguist opens a FoLiA XML document, colour-codes one annotation layer at a time across the text, inspects each word's tokens and spans by hovering, and corrects or adds annotations in a per-word dialog, with confidence values and annotator provenance recorded in the file. Data used in the run: example. tree.json is the workflow the agent did and a second agent replayed; run.json says how.",
